    "subhead": "Chief Keef and King Louie turned a South Side subgenre into an export. London remade it, Brooklyn imported it back, and the city that invented it got policed for it.",
    "description": "Chicago drill went from Englewood basements in 2012 to London and Brooklyn, while the city that made it faced venue bans and police scrutiny.",
