    "headline": "Black Streamers Built Twitch.\nTwitch Owns the Rails.",
    "subhead": "Kai Cenat's subathons rewrote the platform's subscriber records and AMP turned a group house into a media company. The split on every sub still runs through Amazon.",
    "description": "Kai Cenat's Mafiathon records and AMP's rise made Twitch culture Black culture. The subscription split and platform rails still belong to Amazon.",
