    "heroCreditUrl": "https://houston.culturemap.com/news/entertainment/kanye-west-2026-tour-houston/",
    "body": "Look at the next five weeks on Ye's calendar and it reads like a movie trailer. A trial date, an international stadium debut, and a Halloween night in Houston. Only one of those has a stage.\n\n## The Houston show\n[CultureMap Houston](https://houston.culturemap.com/news/entertainment/kanye-west-2026-tour-houston/) has it on Saturday, Oct. 31 at the city's stadium, listed as Reliant Stadium on the ticket pages. Presale opened Sept. 8 and general sales followed Sept. 10. The production they describe is a spherical stage with visuals of the Earth and the moon projected onto it. That's the set the Ye Live Concert Tour has been carrying.\n\n## The run so far\nThe tour supports *Bully*, released in March 2026. CultureMap notes earlier stops in San Antonio on July 4 and Chicago on Sept. 3 and 4, with Houston, Arlington on Nov. 7 and Phoenix on Nov. 21 added after. [Billboard's report on the added dates](https://www.billboard.com/music/rb-hip-hop/kanye-west-us-tour-stadium-shows-dallas-houston-phoenix-1236331481/) frames it as three more U.S. stadiums.\n\n## What sits in front of it\nBefore Houston there's Jakarta, Ye's first-ever Indonesia concert, announced as his only Southeast Asia stop ([Malay Mail](https://www.malaymail.com/news/showbiz/2026/07/26/ye-announces-first-ever-indonesia-concert-bringing-his-only-se-asia-tour-stop-to-jakarta-this-october/228997)). And before that, a court date: the Donda Academy discrimination trial is set for Oct. 12, and as of the latest reporting the judge hasn't ruled on Ye's request to move it to May 2027, per [HotNewHipHop](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1010732-kanye-west-civil-trial-pushed-back). The trial, the tour dates and the delay request all live in the same month.\n\n## The cultural read\nWhatever you think of the man, few artists in rap are booking globe stages in stadiums on Halloween. The GOAT keeps building the biggest room he can and filling it. The calendar decides how much of it he gets to play.\n\n## Sources\n- [CultureMap Houston](https://houston.culturemap.com/news/entertainment/kanye-west-2026-tour-houston/)\n- [Billboard: added U.S. stadium dates](https://www.billboard.com/music/rb-hip-hop/kanye-west-us-tour-stadium-shows-dallas-houston-phoenix-1236331481/)\n- [Malay Mail: Jakarta announcement, July 26, 2026](https://www.malaymail.com/news/showbiz/2026/07/26/ye-announces-first-ever-indonesia-concert-bringing-his-only-se-asia-tour-stop-to-jakarta-this-october/228997)\n- [HotNewHipHop: trial delay request, Sept. 23, 2026](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1010732-kanye-west-civil-trial-pushed-back)\n\nBuilt for the culture. Operated by PHRHX through Sneakz & Beatz LLC. Black-owned, four pillars: sneakers, hip-hop, anime, gaming.",
