    "slug": "quavo-complex-interview-three-migos-takeoff-projects-2027-tyler-top-25-verse-qromelife-reviews-october-2-2026",
    "pillar": "hiphop",
    "title": "Quavo: Three Migos-Related Albums Coming in 2027",
    "headline": "Quavo Puts Three Migos\nProjects on 2027",
    "subhead": "With QRÖMELIFE out, HotNewHipHop reports Quavo told Complex that a final Migos album built on Takeoff's recorded vocals, a posthumous Takeoff record and a Quavo-Takeoff joint project all land next year. Tyler says his 'Baby Breath' verse is top 25 ever. The first reviews are in.",
    "description": "QRÖMELIFE is out, and Quavo reportedly says 2027 brings a final Migos album with Takeoff vocals, a posthumous Takeoff album and a joint project. Plus Tyler's claim and first reviews.",
    "keywords": [
      "Quavo",
      "QRÖMELIFE",
      "Migos",
      "Takeoff",
      "Offset",
      "Pharrell",
      "Tyler the Creator",
      "Baby Breath",
      "Quavo 2027",
      "Quality Control",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX",
      "Black-owned media"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "QUAVO PUTS THREE MIGOS\nPROJECTS ON 2027",
    "ogAccent": "C9A227",
    "trendScore": 90,
    "heroCredit": "uDiscover Music / Universal Music",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.udiscovermusic.com/news/quavo-qromelife/",
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "heroImage": "https://www.udiscovermusic.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/quavo-qromelife.jpg",
    "body": "QRÖMELIFE is out. We ran [the tracklist](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/quavo-qromelife-tracklist-tyler-the-creator-asap-rocky-offset-future-lil-baby-justin-timberlake-october-2-2026) and [the Offset reunion](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/quavo-offset-reunite-qromelife-listening-session-away-first-collab-five-years-migos-album-september-27-2026) already. The news on release day is what Quavo said about next year.\n\n## Three projects, one calendar\n[HotNewHipHop](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1011584-quavo-migos-related-albums-2027), reporting on Quavo's recent Complex interview, says three Migos-adjacent albums are coming in 2027: a Migos reunion album with Offset, a posthumous Takeoff album, and a Quavo-and-Takeoff joint project. [Complex's own release-day rundown](https://www.complex.com/music/a/dimassanfiorenzo/quavo-qromelife-album-tracklist-features-producers-release) confirms the first piece, a final Migos album built on vocals Takeoff recorded before he was killed in November 2022, plus a tour behind it. The posthumous solo record and the joint project rest on HotNewHipHop's account for now. Last month he told Baller Alert the group album might land around [the January anniversary](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/quavo-migos-album-january-anniversary-not-culture-tour-qromelife-october-2-2026). Now it reads like a slate.\n\nOn Offset, he was careful to speak only for himself: Takeoff's death \"threw out all the things that I was upset about or that we had friction about. It was enough for me to say, alright, cool. Whatever you're going through, I'll go through with you.\"\n\n!youtube(https://youtu.be/M5PZIuXHIc4)\n\n## What the record is\nFourteen songs via Quality Control and Motown, every beat by Pharrell, recorded over a year and a half in sessions that ran from Louis Vuitton's Paris headquarters to a yacht in Miami, per [uDiscover](https://www.udiscovermusic.com/news/quavo-qromelife/). Nine guests on seven songs. Complex splits the list into Atlanta (T.I. on \"Backwards,\" Future rapping straight on \"BA,\" Lil Baby on \"Ball My Love,\" Offset on \"Away\") and everybody else (Pharrell, Tyler and Rocky on \"Baby Breath,\" Yung Miami on \"HAOYU DEWDAT,\" Justin Timberlake on the house-beat \"House Music\"). \"Backwards\" also carries an uncredited Jermaine Dupri vocal.\n\n![Quavo via HotNewHipHop](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/imgprst/2292x1200-fit-81-auto/2026/10/2019-02-17T022407Z_2046846576_MT1USATODAY12175730_RTRMADP_3_FEB-16-2019-CHARLOTTE-NC-USA-RECORDING-ART-QUAVO-OF-THE-scaled.jpg \"HotNewHipHop|https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1011584-quavo-migos-related-albums-2027\")\n\n## Tyler's claim\nBefore release, Tyler, The Creator promoted his \"Baby Breath\" verse as \"my best verse of all time... prolly top 25 in rap history,\" adding, \"What I did to the English language is insane and shall be studied,\" per [HotNewHipHop](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1011646-tyler-the-creator-quavo-baby-breath-best-verse). That's a dare. Scorecards out.\n\n## First reviews\n[Ratings Game Music](https://ratingsgamemusic.com/2026/10/02/quavo-qromelife-album-review/) gave it 4 out of 5, with 12 of 14 tracks at 4/5 and \"Baby Breath\" as its No. 1 song. Their line: \"seriously unserious,\" an album \"for the streets\" that \"practically drags you out the front door by your wrist.\" We haven't seen a first-week projection yet; the number lands next week.\n\n## Two kids\nOn Spotify's Countdown To with Yung Miami, Quavo confirmed the daughter he [showed days ago](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/quavo-first-child-daughter-qromelife-short-film-idea-generation-fatherhood-september-29-2026) has a brother. \"I have a boy and I have a girl,\" he said, per [XXL](https://www.xxlmag.com/quavo-two-children/). \"My dad died at four so I just want to be present all the time.\"\n\n![Quavo via XXL](https://townsquare.media/site/812/files/2026/10/attachment-quavo-7.jpg?w=1200&format=natural \"XXL|https://www.xxlmag.com/quavo-two-children/\")\n\n## The read\nA posthumous Takeoff album is the most delicate release in this slate, and the one the culture will police hardest. Who controls those vocals, how they're credited, and who gets paid are the questions to ask before January. Quavo has handled Take's memory with care so far. The record on that is the record that matters.\n\n## Sources\n- [Complex, Oct. 2, 2026: Quavo's Pharrell-produced album QRÖMELIFE, everything you need to know](https://www.complex.com/music/a/dimassanfiorenzo/quavo-qromelife-album-tracklist-features-producers-release)\n- [HotNewHipHop, Oct. 1, 2026: Quavo confirms three new Migos-related projects dropping in 2027](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1011584-quavo-migos-related-albums-2027)\n- [uDiscover Music, Oct. 2, 2026: Quavo releases QRÖMELIFE](https://www.udiscovermusic.com/news/quavo-qromelife/)\n- [HotNewHipHop, Oct. 1, 2026: Tyler calls his Baby Breath verse top 25](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1011646-tyler-the-creator-quavo-baby-breath-best-verse)\n- [Ratings Game Music, Oct. 2, 2026: QRÖMELIFE album review](https://ratingsgamemusic.com/2026/10/02/quavo-qromelife-album-review/)\n- [XXL, Oct. 1, 2026: Quavo reveals he has two children](https://www.xxlmag.com/quavo-two-children/)\n\nBuilt for the culture. Operated by PHRHX through Sneakz & Beatz LLC. Black-owned, four pillars: sneakers, hip-hop, anime, gaming.",
