    "slug": "air-jordan-11-wmns-space-jam-iridescent-iz1800-200-third-pair-30th-anniversary-holiday-2026-235",
    "pillar": "sneakers",
    "title": "A Third Space Jam Air Jordan 11: Women's, Iridescent, $235",
    "headline": "Third Space Jam 11:\nIridescent, Women's Only",
    "subhead": "IZ1800-200 surfaced in official Nike photos on Sept. 30: a matte iridescent upper that shifts green to purple in place of patent leather, a black midsole, and Holiday 2026 timing. Sneaker News confirms it's tied to the film; the nickname is still under wraps.",
    "description": "The Air Jordan 11 WMNS 'Space Jam' (IZ1800-200) surfaced Sept. 30: iridescent green-to-purple upper, black midsole, women's only, Holiday 2026 at $235. Third 11 in the set.",
    "keywords": [
      "Air Jordan 11 Space Jam",
      "IZ1800-200",
      "Air Jordan 11 WMNS",
      "Space Jam 30th anniversary",
      "Light British Tan",
      "iridescent Air Jordan 11",
      "Holiday 2026",
      "Air Jordan 11 2026",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX",
      "Black-owned media"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "THIRD SPACE JAM 11:\nIRIDESCENT, WOMEN'S ONLY",
    "ogAccent": "2F6B3A",
    "trendScore": 78,
    "heroCredit": "Sneaker News / Nike",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/30/air-jordan-11-wmns-space-jam-iz1800-200/",
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "heroImage": "https://sneakernews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/air-jordan-11-wmns-space-jam-IZ1800-200-1.jpg",
    "body": "The 11 you expected is the [Dec. 12 \"Space Jam\"](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/air-jordan-11-space-jam-ct8012-900-december-12-255-first-look-2026). The 11 you didn't is this one.\n\n## What surfaced\nOn Sept. 30, [Sneaker News](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/30/air-jordan-11-wmns-space-jam-iz1800-200/) published official brand photos of a women's-exclusive Air Jordan 11, style IZ1800-200, from the Space Jam 30th Anniversary collection. The patent leather is gone; in its place is a matte, iridescent upper that shifts between green and purple depending on the angle. Black midsole. Sneaker News describes the outsole as opaque, while [House of Heat](https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-11-space-jam-womens-light-british-tan-iz1800-200) and Sole Retriever see an icy semi-translucent one, so wait for detailed photos on that. Women's sizing with extended runs, Holiday 2026, $235 per Sneaker News and [Sneaker Bar Detroit](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-11-wmns-space-jam-2026/). House of Heat lists Nov. 11 and $255; treat both as unconfirmed.\n\n## The story is embargoed\nSneaker News says it \"can confirm the colorway is directly inspired by the original Space Jam film, although the shoe's official nickname and complete story behind the design cannot yet be disclosed.\" The colorway reads Light British Tan/Off Noir/Metallic Silver on paper. Sole Retriever is calling it \"Magic Ball\"; Sneaker Bar Detroit guesses the glowing basketball from the movie. Nobody has it from Jordan Brand yet.\n\n![Air Jordan 11 WMNS \"Space Jam\" on foot via House of Heat](https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pu5wtzfc/production/66a4214f5a6574abd71cc36c945e5166c8443592-2000x1288.png?rect=0,119,2000,1050&w=1200&h=630 \"House of Heat|https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-11-space-jam-womens-light-british-tan-iz1800-200\")\n\n## The set so far\nPer House of Heat's [30th-anniversary guide](https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-space-jam-2026-release-guide): the Air Jordan 9 \"Space Jam\" already dropped Sept. 19 and [sat near retail](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/air-jordan-9-space-jam-sold-out-snkrs-resale-near-retail-sept-19-2026); the Air Jordan 11 \"Green Screen\" (IQ5700-900) is mid-November; the Air Jordan 11 \"Space Jam\" (CT8012-900) is Dec. 12; this women's pair lands in between; and there's an Air Jordan 1 Low \"Air Bugs\" for little kids. Three 11s in one holiday is a lot of 11s, which is exactly the thing [Nike said Thursday it's going to stop doing](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/nike-ceo-elliott-hill-jordan-retro-releases-cut-2027-back-to-scarcity-model-q1-fy27-earnings-call-october-1-2026).\n\n![Air Jordan 11 WMNS \"Space Jam\" via Sneaker Bar Detroit](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/air-jordan-11-womens-space-jam-iz1800-200.webp \"Sneaker Bar Detroit / Nike|https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-11-wmns-space-jam-2026/\")\n\n## The read\nA women's-exclusive 11 with a new material story is a better idea than a third black-and-white retro. The 11 is the culture's dress shoe, and women have been buying men's sizes of it for thirty years. If the extended sizing is real, this is the first Space Jam 11 that was built for them instead of resized for them.\n\n## Sources\n- [Sneaker News, Sept. 30, 2026: A third Air Jordan 11 from the Space Jam collection is revealed](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/30/air-jordan-11-wmns-space-jam-iz1800-200/)\n- [Sneaker Bar Detroit, Oct. 1, 2026: Air Jordan 11 WMNS \"Space Jam\" 2026](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-11-wmns-space-jam-2026/)\n- [House of Heat, Oct. 1, 2026: Air Jordan 11 \"Space Jam\" women's Light British Tan](https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-11-space-jam-womens-light-british-tan-iz1800-200)\n- [House of Heat, Oct. 1, 2026: Space Jam 30th anniversary release guide](https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-space-jam-2026-release-guide)\n\nBuilt for the culture. Operated by PHRHX through Sneakz & Beatz LLC. Black-owned, four pillars: sneakers, hip-hop, anime, gaming.",
