    "slug": "naruto-new-limited-tv-anime-series-viz-nycc-whats-next-stage-october-10-takeuchi-sugiyama-pierrot-2026",
    "pillar": "anime",
    "title": "Naruto's Next Anime Is a 'Limited' TV Series. NYCC Gets the Reveal.",
    "headline": "Naruto Returns to TV\nas a Limited Series",
    "subhead": "VIZ Media confirmed a new Naruto TV anime limited series is in the works. Details land Oct. 10, Naruto's birthday, at the 'NARUTO: What's Next?' stage at New York Comic Con, with Junko Takeuchi, Noriaki Sugiyama and Studio Pierrot's Yoshihiro Tominaga, streamed worldwide.",
    "description": "A new Naruto TV anime limited series is confirmed. Full details come Oct. 10 at NYCC's 'NARUTO: What's Next?' stage, streamed on the official YouTube channel. Not a film.",
    "keywords": [
      "Naruto",
      "Naruto new anime",
      "Naruto limited series",
      "NYCC 2026",
      "VIZ Media",
      "Studio Pierrot",
      "Junko Takeuchi",
      "Noriaki Sugiyama",
      "Naruto Card Game",
      "Naruto birthday October 10",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX",
      "Black-owned media"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "NARUTO RETURNS TO TV\nAS A LIMITED SERIES",
    "ogAccent": "F28C28",
    "trendScore": 78,
    "heroCredit": "Siliconera / Pierrot",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.siliconera.com/new-naruto-limited-anime-series-will-appear-at-nycc-2026/",
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "heroImage": "https://www.siliconera.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/naruto-limited-anime-series-will-appear-at-nycc-2026.jpg",
    "body": "Last week [Variety reported a new Naruto anime film](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/naruto-new-anime-film-expected-nycc-october-10-variety-report-2026) was expected at NYCC. The official word is more specific: it's a TV series, and it's limited.\n\n## What's confirmed\nPer the press release carried by [Anime News Network](https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/press-release/2026-09-29/new-naruto-tv-anime-limited-series-details-to-be-revealed-at-new-york-comic-con-2026/.242316), dated Sept. 28, the \"NARUTO: What's Next?\" special stage at New York Comic Con \"will reveal new details about a New NARUTO TV Anime Limited Series.\" That's the entire official description. The stage runs Saturday, Oct. 10, 5 to 6 p.m. ET on the Empire Stage at the Javits Center, which is also Naruto Uzumaki's canonical birthday, and streams worldwide on the NARUTO/BORUTO official YouTube channel (6 to 7 a.m. JST Sunday in Japan). [Complex](https://www.complex.com/pop-culture/a/treyalston/naruto-new-anime-series-nycc-2026) has VIZ Media confirming the series exists and holding everything else for the panel. A countdown is live on the official site.\n\n## Who's on stage\nJunko Takeuchi, the Japanese voice of Naruto, and Noriaki Sugiyama, Sasuke, with Yoshihiro Tominaga of Studio Pierrot, executive producer at Pierrot Films. The panel also previews Bandai's Naruto Card Game ahead of its 2027 global launch, with a promo video.\n\n![Naruto limited series announcement via Complex](https://images.complex.com/complex/image/upload/c_crop,h_1080,w_1920,x_0,y_0/g_auto:aoi_768_432_384_216,ar_1.91,c_fill,q_auto,w_1200/sanity-new/exfgd6idwpb0gx5shsbj \"Complex / VIZ Media|https://www.complex.com/pop-culture/a/treyalston/naruto-new-anime-series-nycc-2026\")\n\n## The open question\nPierrot announced a four-episode 20th-anniversary Naruto anime in March 2023, then delayed it indefinitely that August \"to improve quality.\" Whether this limited series is that project, revived, or something new, nobody official has said. \"Limited\" fits a four-episode run. It also fits a lot of other things. We'll know on the 10th.\n\n## Why this room cares\nNo anime gets name-checked in rap more than Naruto. The Akatsuki cloak became a wardrobe, the Boruto era lost a lot of that audience, and a short, high-budget run of new Naruto, not Boruto, is the version of this franchise that generation actually wants. The Lionsgate live-action film with Destin Daniel Cretton is in casting. The animated side is where the credibility lives.\n\n## Sources\n- [Anime News Network, Sept. 29, 2026: New Naruto TV anime limited series details to be revealed at New York Comic Con 2026](https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/press-release/2026-09-29/new-naruto-tv-anime-limited-series-details-to-be-revealed-at-new-york-comic-con-2026/.242316)\n- [Complex, Sept. 29, 2026: Naruto returns to television with a limited anime](https://www.complex.com/pop-culture/a/treyalston/naruto-new-anime-series-nycc-2026)\n- [Anime Trending, Sept. 29, 2026: Naruto teases limited TV anime series at NYCC 2026](https://anitrendz.net/news/2026/09/29/naruto-teases-limited-tv-anime-series-at-new-york-comic-con-2026/)\n- [Siliconera, Sept. 29, 2026: New Naruto limited anime series will appear at NYCC 2026](https://www.siliconera.com/new-naruto-limited-anime-series-will-appear-at-nycc-2026/)\n\nBuilt for the culture. Operated by PHRHX through Sneakz & Beatz LLC. Black-owned, four pillars: sneakers, hip-hop, anime, gaming.",
