    "title": "Dragon Ball Super: Beerus Hits Netflix in the U.S. Oct. 17, Weekly",
    "headline": "Beerus Streams on\nNetflix Oct. 17",
    "subhead": "Netflix confirmed Oct. 1 that the remake streams weekly in the U.S. starting Oct. 17, six days after each Japanese episode and Crunchyroll's Oct. 11 simulcast in Europe, the Middle East and Africa. The NYCC panel is Oct. 8 with the English Beerus and Whis.",
    "description": "Dragon Ball Super: Beerus comes to Netflix in the U.S. on Oct. 17, weekly, six days after Japan. Crunchyroll simulcasts from Oct. 11 in EMEA. NYCC panel Oct. 8. Trailer inside.",
