    "slug": "ps5-qssr-ai-upscaling-base-ps5-wolverine-ghost-of-yotei-patched-complete-edition-reviews-october-1-2026",
    "pillar": "gaming",
    "title": "Sony Brings AI Upscaling to the Base PS5. Yotei and Wolverine Got It First.",
    "headline": "AI Upscaling Hits\nthe Base PS5",
    "subhead": "QSSR, a 'performance tier' of PS5 Pro's PSSR built with AMD, patched into Marvel's Wolverine and Ghost of Yōtei on Oct. 1 and will be offered to all PlayStation developers. Same day, Yōtei's Complete Edition launched to strong reviews with Jin Sakai playable.",
    "description": "Sony's QSSR brings PSSR-style AI upscaling to the standard PS5, starting with Marvel's Wolverine and Ghost of Yōtei on Oct. 1. Plus the Complete Edition's launch reviews.",
    "keywords": [
      "PS5 QSSR",
      "AI upscaling PS5",
      "PSSR",
      "Project Amethyst",
      "Marvel's Wolverine",
      "Ghost of Yotei Complete Edition",
      "Echoes of Sekigahara",
      "Most Wanted mode",
      "Jin Sakai",
      "PlayStation Blog",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX",
      "Black-owned media"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "AI UPSCALING HITS\nTHE BASE PS5",
    "ogAccent": "0070D1",
    "trendScore": 66,
    "heroCredit": "PlayStation Blog / Sony Interactive Entertainment",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://blog.playstation.com/2026/10/01/ai-upscaling-is-coming-to-ps5/",
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "heroImage": "https://blog.playstation.com/tachyon/2026/10/5f2b04388e41b48507f4c8d57ce8f53bd059f03a.jpg",
    "body": "The PS5 Pro's best trick is coming down to the console most people own.\n\n## QSSR\nOn Oct. 1 the [PlayStation Blog](https://blog.playstation.com/2026/10/01/ai-upscaling-is-coming-to-ps5/) announced Quick Spectral Super Resolution, a \"performance tier\" of the PS5 Pro's PSSR AI upscaler, written up by Sony graphics engineer Daniel Craig. It comes out of Project Amethyst, Sony's AI graphics partnership with AMD, and runs on the base PS5 through a streamlined neural network and a hand-tuned implementation, since the standard console lacks the Pro's dedicated machine-learning hardware. Sony's framing: PSSR \"remains the gold standard\" on Pro, and QSSR \"provides some notable improvements to both image detail and image stability\" on PS5. [Engadget](https://www.engadget.com/2274744/sony-brings-ai-upscaling-to-the-base-ps5.html) and [VGC](https://www.videogameschronicle.com/news/remarkable-sony-reveals-new-ps5-upscaler-tech-qssr/) both ran it the same morning.\n\n!youtube(https://youtu.be/RcFYsDKbAIk)\n\n## First two games\nMarvel's Wolverine and Ghost of Yōtei were patched Oct. 1 to add QSSR as a graphics option. Insomniac's Mike Fitzgerald says it \"adds more pixel-level clarity and stability\" across Madripoor and Shinjuku; Sucker Punch's Jasmin Patry says it resolves fine detail \"with a level of temporal stability that hasn't been possible on the PS5 console until now.\" Sony says the library will be offered broadly to developers.\n\n![QSSR on PS5 via Engadget](https://www.engadget.com/img/gallery/sony-brings-ai-upscaling-to-the-base-ps5/l-intro-1790873905.jpg \"Engadget / Sony|https://www.engadget.com/2274744/sony-brings-ai-upscaling-to-the-base-ps5.html\")\n\n## Yōtei's Complete Edition, same day\nThe [Complete Edition](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/ghost-of-yotei-complete-edition-october-1-echoes-of-sekigahara-most-wanted-2026) launched Oct. 1, $69.99 new or a $14.99 upgrade. [VGC's review](https://www.videogameschronicle.com/review/ghost-of-yotei-complete-edition/) calls Most Wanted \"a compelling take on the roguelike genre\": you're stripped to base abilities, fight escalating waves toward a member of the Yōtei Six, and unlock characters including Jin Sakai from Ghost of Tsushima. Echoes of Sekigahara is the story expansion, about five hours plus side content, set in a new smaller region with flashbacks to Atsu's war years, giant weapons and a three-arrow deadeye. VGC's verdict: \"a vital new chapter,\" with the caveat \"it's a shame it isn't longer.\" Erika Ishii, Atsu's voice, [spoke to the PS Blog](https://blog.playstation.com/2026/10/02/ghost-of-yotei-complete-edition-erika-ishii-interview/) Friday.\n\n![Ghost of Yōtei Complete Edition via VGC](https://www.videogameschronicle.com/files/2026/10/yotei-complete-social.jpg \"VGC / Sucker Punch|https://www.videogameschronicle.com/review/ghost-of-yotei-complete-edition/\")\n\n## The read\nSony sold the Pro on an upscaler and then gave the standard console a version of it for free, in the same month its Japan arm is making people prove playtime to buy a Pro. The message is consistent: the base PS5 is the platform through GTA 6 season, and it's getting better, not sunset. A $15 Yōtei expansion with Jin in it, running cleaner than it did Monday, is the sales pitch in one patch.\n\n## Sources\n- [PlayStation Blog, Oct. 1, 2026: AI upscaling is coming to PS5](https://blog.playstation.com/2026/10/01/ai-upscaling-is-coming-to-ps5/)\n- [Engadget, Oct. 1, 2026: Sony brings AI upscaling to the base PS5](https://www.engadget.com/2274744/sony-brings-ai-upscaling-to-the-base-ps5.html)\n- [VGC, Oct. 1, 2026: Ghost of Yōtei Complete Edition review](https://www.videogameschronicle.com/review/ghost-of-yotei-complete-edition/)\n- [PlayStation Blog, Oct. 2, 2026: Ghost of Yōtei Complete Edition, Erika Ishii interview](https://blog.playstation.com/2026/10/02/ghost-of-yotei-complete-edition-erika-ishii-interview/)\n\nBuilt for the culture. Operated by PHRHX through Sneakz & Beatz LLC. Black-owned, four pillars: sneakers, hip-hop, anime, gaming.",
