    "subhead": "IQ5492-001 went up on Nike.com Friday: black nubuck, cracked leather overlays, exposed 'XXIII' stitching, a possessed Jumpman on the tongue and a green glow-in-the-dark sole. Sneaker News had it for mid-October at $130; it's $140 and it's out.",
