    "body": "Nike's Halloween 2026 run keeps growing, and the Jumpman's piece of it just doubled.\n\n## The drop\nAir Jordan 1 Mid SE \"Halloween,\" IQ5492-001, Black/Sequoia/Scream Green. [Sneaker Bar Detroit](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-1-mid-halloween-iq5492-001/) reports it's available now on Nike.com for $140, dated Oct. 2. [Sneaker News](https://sneakernews.com/2026/10/01/air-jordan-1-mid-halloween-iq5492-001/) published the official images Oct. 1 with a mid-to-late October window and a $130 price in the text; the Nike listing settled both.\n\n## The build\nBlack nubuck base, cracked and craggy leather over the toe, eyestays, ankle and heel, with Scream Green showing at the edges of the cracked Swoosh. Exposed \"XXIII\" stitching down the lateral side, the same Voodoo-doll idea as the [Air Jordan 1 Low \"Halloween\"](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/air-jordan-1-low-halloween-black-neon-green-glow-iq5494-001-official-images-2026). The tongue gets a \"possessed\" Jumpman with a hazy green outline, the insoles get green Jumpmen, a black Wings logo is stamped at the ankle, and the outsole glows green. Sneaker News notes the Low's raw, highlighter-edged leather is replaced here by standard finishes, so the Mid reads cleaner in daylight and does its work after dark.\n\n![Air Jordan 1 Mid \"Halloween\" via Sneaker Bar Detroit](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/air-jordan-1-mid-halloween-iq5492-001-8.jpg \"Sneaker Bar Detroit / Nike|https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-1-mid-halloween-iq5492-001/\")\n\n## The rest of the Jumpman's October\nThe [Air Jordan 5 \"Halloween\"](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/air-jordan-5-halloween-hq7978-001-glow-detailed-look-october-17-2026) is the headline pair later this month, with Sneaker News and House of Heat on Oct. 17 and Sole Retriever and Nice Kicks on Oct. 24. The Mid is the one you can get today without a raffle.\n\n## The read\nMids don't get love from the people who argue about Jordans on the internet. They get worn by the people who buy them at the mall, which is a bigger group. A $140 glow-in-the-dark Mid that's in stock on a Friday is the kind of shoe the discount era produced, and the kind of shoe [the scarcity era](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/nike-ceo-elliott-hill-jordan-retro-releases-cut-2027-back-to-scarcity-model-q1-fy27-earnings-call-october-1-2026) will trim first.\n\n## Sources\n- [Sneaker Bar Detroit, Oct. 2, 2026: Air Jordan 1 Mid \"Halloween\" glows in the dark](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-1-mid-halloween-iq5492-001/)\n- [Sneaker News, Oct. 1, 2026: Spooky stitching preps the Air Jordan 1 Mid for Halloween](https://sneakernews.com/2026/10/01/air-jordan-1-mid-halloween-iq5492-001/)\n- [Nike.com: Air Jordan 1 Mid SE IQ5492-001](https://www.nike.com/t/air-jordan-1-mid-se-mens-shoes-GIUU0K5y/IQ5492-001)\n\nBuilt for the culture. Operated by PHRHX through Sneakz & Beatz LLC. Black-owned, four pillars: sneakers, hip-hop, anime, gaming.",
