    "title": "Gears of War: E-Day Lands at 88 on Metacritic",
    "headline": "Gears of War: E-Day\nLands at 88",
    "subhead": "The review embargo lifted Oct. 1. Critics are calling it the best Gears in years, with one loud dissent.",
    "description": "Gears of War: E-Day reviews are in. Metacritic sits at 88, higher than Gears 4 and 5. Scores from IGN, The Guardian and more, plus launch date and Game Pass details.",
