    "body": "The full Summer Madness XVI card has been on the URLTV app since Sept. 29. Now the clips are coming.\n\n## What's posted\n[Ultimate Rap League's X account](https://x.com/urltv) is putting out short cuts from individual battles. As of this morning that includes [Nu Jerzey Twork vs Ave](https://x.com/urltv/status/2106067360637419532), [Ave vs Twork](https://x.com/urltv/status/2106059712596734195), [Ill Will vs Chess](https://x.com/urltv/status/2106053117477257715), [Chess vs Ill Will](https://x.com/urltv/status/2106044606936760783) and [Arsonal vs Snake Eyez](https://x.com/urltv/status/2106037178975285407). Each post points back to the app, with membership at $8.99.\n\n## What it tells you\nClips are the funnel. A minute of bars gets shared, argued over and quoted, and the full battle sits behind the paywall. URL is a Black-owned league running its own distribution, and this is how it works.\n\n## What we're not doing\nA minute-long clip isn't a battle. We aren't calling winners from edits, and we haven't posted any lyrics here. Watch the full rounds on the app first. The Tay Roc and Rum Nitty rematch and the Tay Roc vs Illmac booking for London on Oct. 25 are covered in our earlier piece.\n\n## Sources\n- [Ultimate Rap League on X](https://x.com/urltv)\n- [URL post: Nu Jerzey Twork vs Ave](https://x.com/urltv/status/2106067360637419532)\n- [URL post: Ill Will vs Chess](https://x.com/urltv/status/2106053117477257715)\n- [URL post: Arsonal vs Snake Eyez](https://x.com/urltv/status/2106037178975285407)\n\nBuilt for the culture. Operated by PHRHX through Sneakz & Beatz LLC. Black-owned, four pillars: sneakers, hip-hop, anime, gaming.",
