    "trendScore": 66,
    "heroCredit": "SneakerFiles",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.sneakerfiles.com/air-jordan-15-snakeskin/",
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "body": "The Air Jordan 15 \"Snakeskin\" releases November 7, 2026, at $240 under style code IZ2585-001. All black, all leather, with a textured snakeskin overlay where the shoe's woven midfoot panel normally sits, per SneakerFiles.\n\nReal talk: the 15 was never the shoe everybody agreed on. Tinker Hatfield drew it off the X-15 rocket plane, it looked like nothing else in 1999, and the culture has been arguing about it ever since. A black-on-black version with exotic texture is the safest way to bring it back. You don't have to love the shape. You just have to like how it looks in the dark.\n\n## It's one piece of a four-shoe set\n\nThis is the Air Jordan Black Pack. Sneaker News lists four silhouettes: the 14 Low in black ostrich leather ($240, October 3), the 17 Low with nubuck sides and stingray leather around the eyelets, the 15 in snakeskin, and the 16. Same idea across the board. One color, premium skins, small runs.\n\nIf you missed the [Air Jordan 14 Forest Green](/the-lane/air-jordan-14-forest-green-487471-300-october-31-2026-215) conversation, this is the opposite energy. Forest Green is a nostalgia pull. The Black Pack is a texture pull.\n\n## Where it's sold\n\nSneakerFiles says SNKRS and select neighborhood retailers. That means limited, and it means the usual scramble. If you want a pair, find your local shop's raffle early. For background on why this era of Jordans matters, read our breakdown of the [15, 16 and 17 and the Wizards years](/the-lane/air-jordan-15-16-17-washington-wizards-years-briefcase-retro-return).\n\n## What we couldn't confirm\n\nThe 17 Low's price was still listed as TBA in the sources we checked. We're not guessing it. Check Nike SNKRS before you plan around a number.\n\n## Sources\n- [SneakerFiles, Air Jordan 15 \"Snakeskin\" Releases November 2026](https://www.sneakerfiles.com/air-jordan-15-snakeskin/)\n- [Sneaker News, Air Jordan Black Pack, June 23, 2026](https://sneakernews.com/2026/06/23/air-jordan-black-pack/)\n- [Sneaker News, Air Jordan Release Dates October 2026, September 30, 2026](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/30/air-jordan-release-dates-october-2026/)\n- [House of Heat, Jordan Release Dates](https://houseofheat.co/jordan-release-dates)\n",
