    "heroCreditUrl": "https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-11-space-jam-green-screen-release-date",
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "body": "The Air Jordan 11 \"Green Screen\" (IQ5700-900) comes in November 2026 at $255. House of Heat has it November 14. Complex says November 16. That's a two-day gap, so check Nike before you plan a Saturday around it.\n\nThe idea is simple and kind of clever. Space Jam hit in 1996. Everybody remembers the Monstars. Nobody remembers that Michael Jordan spent a lot of that shoot standing in front of a green wall acting like there was a game. The shoe is built on that.\n\n## What you're getting\n\nPer House of Heat: Gym Green, Lucky Green and Orange Peel, with green suede on the tongue and mudguard, in-flight Jordan imagery on the insoles, and a glow-in-the-dark outsole. Custom green packaging with Space Jam callouts. Complex adds that it's a select Nike neighborhood-retailer release, which means limited.\n\n## Why it matters this year\n\nThis is Space Jam's 30th anniversary, and Jordan Brand is milking it in a smart way. The original Space Jam 11 is coming December 12 at $255 ([our look](/the-lane/air-jordan-11-space-jam-ct8012-900-december-12-255-first-look-2026)). The women's Light British Tan pair is a third pair for the same anniversary ([details](/the-lane/air-jordan-11-wmns-space-jam-iridescent-iz1800-200-third-pair-30th-anniversary-holiday-2026-235)). The Green Screen is the one for people who already own the black-and-blue.\n\nLook, $255 for an all-green 11 is a lot. But it's an anniversary shoe with a story, and those tend to hold value better than another recolor.\n\n## What we couldn't confirm\n\nDate: November 14 (House of Heat) vs. November 16 (Complex). Retailers: Complex says neighborhood only; House of Heat points to a third-party reseller and says Nike details were expected later. We'll update when Jordan Brand posts the official page.\n\n## Sources\n- [House of Heat, Air Jordan 11 Space Jam Green Screen](https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-11-space-jam-green-screen-release-date)\n- [Complex, Air Jordan 11 Green Screen release date](https://www.complex.com/sneakers/a/victor-deng/air-jordan-11-green-screen-release-date)\n- [House of Heat, Jordan Release Dates](https://houseofheat.co/jordan-release-dates)\n",
