    "heroFocus": "center",
    "body": "PlayStation Plus Monthly Games for October 2026 are F1 25, Hunt: Showdown 1896 and Earth Defense Force: World Brothers 2. They're available Tuesday, October 6 through Monday, November 2, according to the PlayStation Blog.\n\nShort version: one for the racing heads, one for the squad that likes tension, one for people who just want to blow up giant bugs with friends.\n\n## The lineup\n\nF1 25 (PS5): the official 2025 Formula One game, with single-player career modes and the multiplayer squad racing in F1 World.\n\nHunt: Showdown 1896 (PS5): an extraction shooter. You can go solo or in a team of up to three, fighting what the Blog calls \"timeless evil\" in corrupted backwaters.\n\nEarth Defense Force: World Brothers 2 (PS5, PS4): co-op action with four-player online and two-player local split screen, plus voxel-style enemies.\n\n## The extras\n\nThere are limited Spider-Man: Brand New Day avatars for PS Plus members starting October 6, and horror-themed in-game bundles on various titles through October 20.\n\n## Who this month is for\n\nIf you're already deep in the October releases, this is easy value. Hunt: Showdown has a real learning curve, so give it a few runs before you judge it. EDF is the one to grab if you have a couch partner. For what else is landing on PS5 this month, see our notes on [Hunter's Moon](/the-lane/hunters-moon-ps5-october-26-2026-twin-swans-witchfinder-stealth-horror-state-of-play) and [Phantom Blade Zero](/the-lane/phantom-blade-zero-october-29-development-complete-s-game-ps5-pc-59-99-2026).\n\nHeads up: the PlayStation Blog post we read didn't state price or tier details beyond membership, so we're not guessing at that.\n\n## Sources\n- [PlayStation Blog, PlayStation Plus Monthly Games for October, September 30, 2026](https://blog.playstation.com/2026/09/30/playstation-plus-monthly-games-for-october-f1-25-hunt-showdown-1896-earth-defense-force-world-brothers-2/)\n",
