    "trendScore": 62,
    "body": "Spooky season just got a Jordan-level upgrade.\n\nThe Air Jordan 5 \"Halloween\" (HQ7978-001) is landing October 17, 2026, and it's one of the cleaner retro moves Nike has made for the fall. The colorway runs Black, Picante Red, and Green — a spooky, high-contrast combo that reads like a haunted house at night. It's not trying to be subtle. It's trying to be the pair you reach for when the calendar hits October.\n\n## The Design\n\nThe Air Jordan 5 \"Halloween\" leans into the theme without overdoing it. Black anchors the base, Picante Red pops through the midfoot and accents, and Green carries the spooky edge through the details. It's a Halloween-themed colorway that actually looks like it belongs on a Jordan 5 — not a forced mashup. The silhouette already has the right proportions for a bold colorway, and this one uses them.\n\n## Release Date & Price\n\nThe Air Jordan 5 \"Halloween\" (HQ7978-001) releases October 17, 2026, via SNKRS and select retailers. The price sits around $215-220 depending on the source — Nice Kicks lists it at $215, while SneakerFiles has it at $220. Either way, it's a standard retro price point for a Jordan 5, which makes it accessible without being a bargain.\n\n## Why It Matters\n\nHalloween colorways on the Jordan 5 have always been a fan favorite, and this one delivers on the promise. It's not a limited-edition gimmick — it's a proper retro with a theme that fits the season and the silhouette. For anyone who wants a pair that works from October through the holidays, this is the move.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [Air Jordan 5 \"Halloween\" (HQ7978-001) — SneakerFiles](https://www.sneakerfiles.com/air-jordan-5-halloween-2026/) — October 17, 2026 release, $220, Black/Picante Red/Green via SNKRS and select retailers.\n- [Air Jordan 5 \"Halloween\" (HQ7978-001) — Nice Kicks](https://www.nicekicks.com/air-jordan-5-halloween-hq7978-001/) — October 17, 2026 release, $215, Halloween-themed colorway via SNKRS and select retailers.\n- First look credit: [House of Heat](https://www.houseofheat.com/)",
