    "headline": "Travis Barker Picks\nHis GOAT Rappers",
    "subhead": "At ComplexCon, Barker went West Coast on the album and named Jay-Z, Kendrick Lamar and Lil Wayne as his GOAT rappers.",
    "description": "Travis Barker named Dr. Dre's The Chronic as his GOAT album and Jay-Z, Kendrick Lamar and Lil Wayne as GOAT rappers at ComplexCon 2026. Here's what he said.",
