    "heroFocus": "center",
    "body": "The Air Jordan 3 \"Santa\" is slated for November 21, 2026 under style code IF4396-601, and the holiday pair is already splitting the sneaker internet on one boring but important question: what does it cost?\n\nSneakerFiles lists it at $165. Sneaker Bar Detroit says $215. Same shoe, same date, a $50 gap. Hedge it until Jordan Brand confirms. If it's the lower number, it's priced like a family-sizing holiday shoe. If it's $215, it's priced like every other Air Jordan 3 this season.\n\n## What's on the shoe\n\nPer Sneaker Freaker, the upper is full red suede with snow-white on the eyestays, tongue, collar and midsole. Deep red elephant print sits on the toe and heel, with black on the Nike Air heel tab and outsole. The extras are the joke: red and green laces, a pair of fluffy white laces, and insoles printed with a snapshot of a Christmas ad. Sneaker Bar Detroit describes the same red-and-cream build.\n\nRead this part carefully. Both outlets are working from mock-ups credited to @zsneakerheadz and @sneakerfiles, so final materials and details can still move before retail.\n\n## Where it sits in the lane\n\nThis is the playful end of a Jordan 3 month. The other November pair is the black \"Not Nice\" version, which is the same IF4396 base in a darker mood. Naughty and nice, sold two colors at a time. That's smart merchandising, and it's also why the Santa will probably sit easier than the Not Nice. Novelty holiday shoes sell to gift buyers. Gift buyers aren't refreshing a launch app at 10 a.m.\n\nReal talk: the elephant print is why the 3 still works. It's the one Tinker Hatfield detail that dresses up or down. Red suede and elephant print in November is a good look with a black hoodie and jeans, no costume needed.\n\nExpect Nike.com and Jordan Brand retailers. No specific stores were named yet, and Jordan Brand typically confirms retailers closer to launch.\n\nBuilt for the culture. Operated from San Diego. Run by PHRHX through Sneakz & Beatz LLC. Black-owned, four pillars: sneakers, hip-hop, anime, gaming.\n\n## Sources\n- [Sneaker Freaker, Air Jordan 3 Santa IF4396-601, 2026](https://www.sneakerfreaker.com/releases/air-jordan-3-santa-IF4396-601-price-buy-release-date)\n- [Sneaker Bar Detroit, Air Jordan 3 Santa 2026](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-3-santa-2026/)\n- [SneakerFiles, Air Jordan Release Dates, accessed Oct. 9, 2026](https://www.sneakerfiles.com/air-jordan-release-dates/)\n",
