    "trendScore": 90,
    "publishedAt": "2026-10-09",
    "goLiveAt": "2026-10-09",
    "body": "Earlier this week the story was a hallway. Ye, Bianca Censori and Playboi Carti moving through the convention floor. Nobody could say he'd taken the stage. That changed.\n\n## What's new\n[Complex's Day 2 recap](https://www.complex.com/style/a/tracewilliamcowen/complexcon-2026-day-2-highlights) says Ye joined Carti for three tracks during the Sunday headline set, with \"Off the Grid\" among them. The same recap says North West was one of the special guests. [HotNewHipHop](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1012069-playboi-carti-kanye-west-complexcon-setlist) lists the three Ye songs as \"Can't Tell Me Nothing,\" \"Carnival\" and \"Off the Grid,\" and says they opened the set. HNHH doesn't cite video or a named witness for its setlist, so treat the exact order as reported, not locked.\n\n## What we're not saying\nWe haven't seen full-set footage. The first Complex piece said organizers made no announcement beforehand, and a surprise guest set doesn't get one. The Netflix Junkie link-up claims from earlier this week are still a single weak source.\n\n## Why it landed\nCarti was an artistic director of the weekend. Ye is the guest nobody lists on a lineup. Three songs from three different eras, one of them off Donda, in front of a Crypto.com Arena crowd. That's a moment.\n\n## Ye's calendar\nThe stage was the easy part. The Donda Academy civil trial is set for Oct. 12, though [HNHH reported](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/tag/kanye-west) Ye asked in September to push it to 2027, and we haven't found a ruling. We also haven't found a result from this week's hearing on his former handyman's $1.23 million fee request. Jakarta is Oct. 24.\n\n## The read\nOne set, three songs, a daughter on stage. Whatever else this month brings, that's the clip people will keep sending.\n\n## Sources\n- [Complex, Oct. 5, 2026: ComplexCon 2026 Day 2 Highlights](https://www.complex.com/style/a/tracewilliamcowen/complexcon-2026-day-2-highlights)\n- [HotNewHipHop, Oct. 5, 2026: Playboi Carti Performs With Kanye West At ComplexCon: Full Setlist](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1012069-playboi-carti-kanye-west-complexcon-setlist)\n- [Complex, Oct. 4, 2026: Kanye West and Bianca Censori Join Playboi Carti at ComplexCon](https://www.complex.com/pop-culture/a/markelibert/kanye-west-bianca-censori-complexcon-2026)"
