    "body": "The Space Jam 11 is coming back for the 30th anniversary. Now we know how big the family is.\n\n## The headline pair\nPer [Sneaker News](https://sneakernews.com/2026/10/08/jordan-11-space-jam/), the black and Varsity Royal Air Jordan 11 \"Space Jam\" lands Dec. 12 in full family sizes. That's 64 days out. We covered the [first look and price](https://www.sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/air-jordan-11-space-jam-ct8012-900-december-12-255-first-look-2026) earlier: $255.\n\n## The rest of the lineup\nSneaker News says the collection runs 12 SKUs and names these. The Air Jordan 11 \"Magic Ball\" women's pair, iridescent with a black midsole, is Nov. 11, women's sizing extended up to 14.5. The Air Jordan 11 \"Green Screen\" is full suede, monochrome green, with orange traction pads. An Air Jordan 11 MCS in monochrome Concord purple is set for holiday.\n\n## One date to hedge\nSneaker News puts Green Screen at Nov. 16. [HotNewHipHop](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1012308-air-jordan-11-green-screen-sneaker-news-4) says Nov. 14 at $255, style code IQ5700-900, with SNKRS and select NBHD stores. Two outlets, two dates. Wait for Jordan Brand.\n\n## What won't release\nA \"Laser\" pair is Friends and Family only. A \"Galaxy\" sample won't release because of production costs. A grade-school Green Screen was left out of retail. If you see them in a hype post, those are not coming.\n\n## The read\nThree big drops in five weeks, all on one silhouette. Pick your pair now and know your sizes.\n\n## Sources\n- [Sneaker News, Oct. 8, 2026: Jordan Brand expands the Space Jam universe](https://sneakernews.com/2026/10/08/jordan-11-space-jam/)\n- [HotNewHipHop, Oct. 7, 2026: Official photos of the Air Jordan 11 \"Green Screen\"](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1012308-air-jordan-11-green-screen-sneaker-news-4)"
