    "trendScore": 85,
    "publishedAt": "2026-10-09",
    "goLiveAt": "2026-10-09",
    "body": "Eleven days out, the clip is pulling numbers.\n\n## The clip\nNetflix posted \"Cyberpunk: Edgerunners 2 | Something Real | Sneak Peek\" on YouTube. When we checked, the main upload sat near 1.9 million views after two days, and a second upload on the Netflix Anime channel was near 868,000. We're reporting the view counts, not the scenes. We haven't broken the clip down for you.\n\n## What's confirmed\nPer [Netflix's Tudum page](https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/cyberpunk-edgerunners-2-release-date-news): a standalone 10-episode story set in the same world, a new group of mercenaries, an all-new voice cast and a reimagined animation style, premiering Oct. 20 on Netflix.\n\n## What isn't\nNetflix's page doesn't say whether all ten episodes arrive at once or weekly. One site claims a full drop, and we couldn't confirm it from Netflix. Plan for Oct. 20, not for a binge.\n\n## Why it matters\nView counts are a pulse. A sneak peek crossing one million that fast says the audience is waiting. The original made people care about Night City, and this one has to earn them back.\n\n## Sources\n- [Netflix Tudum: Cyberpunk: Edgerunners 2 release date news](https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/cyberpunk-edgerunners-2-release-date-news)\n- [YouTube search results for the Netflix and Netflix Anime uploads, checked Oct. 9, 2026](https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=cyberpunk+2077)"
