    "headline": "URL Stacks a London Card\nfor Oct. 25",
    "subhead": "Dizaster vs. Rum Nitty, Calicoe vs. T-Top and Tay Roc vs. Illmac are set for NOME 16. What URL has confirmed so far.",
    "description": "URL announced Dizaster vs. Rum Nitty, Calicoe vs. T-Top and Tay Roc vs. Illmac for NOME 16 in London on Oct. 25. What's confirmed so far.",
