    "heroFocus": "center",
    "trendScore": 84,
    "body": "Space Jam turns 30, and Jordan Brand is building a whole month around the Air Jordan 11.\n\n## The public releases\nPer [Sneaker News](https://sneakernews.com/2026/10/08/jordan-11-space-jam/), the collection totals 12 SKUs. The ones you can actually buy:\n\n## The Air Jordan 11 \"Space Jam\"\nBlack and Varsity Royal, Dec. 12, in full family sizes at Jordan retailers. It goes back to the Varsity Royal shade used in 2000 and 2009. The 2016 pair used a Concord tone. Sneaker News says the details are rebuilt, including a correctly oriented Jumpman and \"JUMPMAN JAM\" lettering on the tongue tie-bar. Earlier reports we ran put the price at $255. We found no price in the Oct. 8 text, so confirm before you budget.\n\n## The rest\nThe women's Air Jordan 11 \"Magic Ball\" is iridescent and lands Nov. 11, in women's sizing up to 14.5. The Air Jordan 11 \"Green Screen\" is monochrome green suede, Nov. 16. An Air Jordan 11 MCS in Concord purple, built for baseball, is set for Holiday with no date.\n\n## What you can't buy\nAn Air Jordan 11 \"Laser,\" with a laser-etched black patent mudguard and a \"30\" on the heel tab, is Friends & Family and select audiences only. Sneaker News says that includes Warner Bros. executives and Jordan Brand leadership. A holographic \"Galaxy\" sample was scrapped because of production cost. A kids' Green Screen sample also missed the retail lineup. Don't chase any of them.\n\n## The read\nThe Space Jam 11 is the centerpiece, and November is the warm-up. Nov. 11, Nov. 16, then Dec. 12. If you're deciding where to spend, the Varsity Royal pair is the one tied to the original film.\n\n## Sources\n- [Sneaker News, Oct. 8, 2026: Jordan Brand expands the Space Jam universe with the Air Jordan 11](https://sneakernews.com/2026/10/08/jordan-11-space-jam/)\n- [Sneakz and Beatz: Air Jordan 11 Space Jam first look](https://www.sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/air-jordan-11-space-jam-ct8012-900-december-12-255-first-look-2026)\n",
