    "headline": "The Disciple\nLands on the 16th",
    "subhead": "Wu-Tang Clan's The Disciple: A Wu-Tang Fable — a third in a line of Netflix documentaries — premieres Oct. 16, 2026, with the trailer dropping today. What's confirmed.",
    "description": "Wu-Tang Clan's third Netflix documentary, The Disciple: A Wu-Tang Fable, premieres Oct. 16, 2026, with a trailer on Oct. 14. Verified by Netflix Tudum and The Hollywood Reporter.",
