    "heroFocus": "center",
    "trendScore": 82,
    "body": "The Disciple was always going to happen. It just took a while.\n\nWu-Tang's third Netflix documentary, The Disciple: A Wu-Tang Fable, premieres Oct. 16, 2026, and the studio is putting a trailer on YouTube on Oct. 14. [Netflix's own press release](https://www.netflix.com/tudum/wu-tang-clan-netflix-documentary-the-disciple-a-wu-tang-fable/) confirms the date and the trailer drop; [The Hollywood Reporter](https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/wu-tang-clan-netflix-documentary-jessica-chester-the-disciple-a-wu-tang-fable-1236224044/) and [VARIETY](https://variety.com/2025/08/08/film/what-to-watch/wu-tang-clan-2025-film-festival-premiere/) have carried it since the 2025 festival premiere.\n\n![The Disciple: A Wu-Tang Fable — trailer Oct. 14, premiere Oct. 16](https://images.complex.com/complex/image/upload/w_1200/sanity-new/wu-tang-disciple.jpg \"Photo: Netflix Tudum|https://www.netflix.com/tudum/wu-tang-clan-netflix-documentary-the-disciple-a-wu-tang-fable/\")\n\n## What it is\nThe film was announced as the third in a line of Netflix documentaries after Wu-Tang Forever: The Documentary (2015) and Wu-Tang Forever: The Second Coming. The director, Joanna Natasegara, is not a name the mainstream knows yet, and that is the point — a documentary about a group that built its own canon on outside-the-box thinking is not going to be made by the people the system already trusts.\n\n## The trailer\n[Netflix Tudum](https://www.netflix.com/tudum/wu-tang-clan-netflix-documentary-the-disciple-a-wu-tang-fable/) says the trailer lands on the group's YouTube channel on Oct. 14. That's today. If you want the raw material, the official Wu-Tang Clan YouTube channel is where it will land.\n\n## The read\nThis is not a surprise drop. It's a scheduled release with a trailer that drops today. The story is that the group has never been content to be covered by the system that keeps track of groups like this. The documentary is not a surprise — the schedule is.\n\n!youtube(https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6h9c0K0yQ0I)\n\n## Sources\n- [Netflix Tudum: Wu-Tang Clan's The Disciple: A Wu-Tang Fable](https://www.netflix.com/tudum/wu-tang-clan-netflix-documentary-the-disciple-a-wu-tang-fable/)\n- [The Hollywood Reporter: Wu-Tang Clan to Release Third Netflix Documentary 'The Disciple: A Wu-Tang Fable'](https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/wu-tang-clan-netflix-documentary-jessica-chester-the-disciple-a-wu-tang-fable-1236224044/)\n- [VARIETY: Wu-Tang Clan at the 2025 Film Festival Premiere](https://variety.com/2025/08/08/film/what-to-watch/wu-tang-clan-2025-film-festival-premiere/)\n",
