    "body": "Houston's finest dropped an EP on Wednesday. It is 304 in the name for a reason.\n\nKenTheMan — Houston, Texas's most consistent independent release — landed I Love 304s on Oct. 13, 2026. It's a 5-track EP, not a full album: \"Pimp K,\" \"OMG,\" \"Popular,\" \"They Call Me,\" and \"Spoil Myself.\" [Blueprint Miami](https://www.blueprintmiami.com/kentheman-releases-i-love-304s-ep/) and [Apple Music](https://music.apple.com/us/album/i-love-304s-ep/6785089314) both carry it. \"304\" is a nod to the Houston area code that recurs across her catalog (\"4 da 304's,\" \"Back To 304'n\"), and it's the kind of thing that only works if you already know the region.\n\n![KenTheMan – I Love 304s EP](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kentheman-i-love-304s.jpg \"Photo: HotNewHipHop|https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1012393-cardi-b-gta-vi-soundtrack\")\n\n## The read\nHouston's independent scene has been the quiet story of 2026 — not because of any one record, but because of the number of records that came out without a label. KenTheMan is part of that wave, and this is a 5-track EP, not a statement. It's a working document. If it moves, it moves because the region moves.\n\n## The unverified\nThe tracklist above is what Apple Music and Blueprint Miami carry. We did not confirm a label, and we did not confirm that this is her first \"304\" EP — the name has appeared before, so treat this as the current release, not a first.\n\n## Sources\n- [Blueprint Miami, Oct. 14, 2026: KenTheMan Releases I Love 304s EP](https://www.blueprintmiami.com/kentheman-releases-i-love-304s-ep/)\n- [Apple Music: KenTheMan – I Love 304s EP](https://music.apple.com/us/album/i-love-304s-ep/6785089314)\n- [Instagram: @kentheman_music](https://www.instagram.com/p/DXjLZ3WjHfj/)\n",
