    "heroCreditUrl": "https://ratingsgamemusic.com/2026/10/14/top-5-stories-of-the-day-october-14-2026/",
    "body": "A$AP Rocky's \"Mushroom Clouds\" is reportedly coming Friday, October 16, as a lead-in to *DON'T BE DUMB (Disc 2)*. The date comes from Ratings Game Music's October 14 rundown, which cites the NFR Podcast and Kurrco posts on X. We haven't seen it confirmed by Rocky's team or a label post, so treat it as reported.\n\n## What's reported\n\nThe record isn't brand new to everyone. Per that rundown, it showed up during his Amazon Music performance. Rocky has also talked about revisiting older songs with fresh verses and teased unreleased work with Metro Boomin. Asked about that, he said, \"Man, you gotta wait.\" Fair answer. Nobody's getting a date out of him.\n\n## Where Disc 2 stands\n\nThe Disc 2 rollout has been drip-fed since at least late August, when Ratings Game Music covered a tease called \"2DUMB.\" No official Disc 2 release date has surfaced in anything we found. That's the real gap here. A single date is not an album date.\n\n## The take\n\nLook, Rocky's always run the slow-roll playbook. Sneak a record live, let the clips circulate, then release it clean. If \"Mushroom Clouds\" lands Friday, it tells us the Disc 2 clock is finally moving. If it doesn't, we're back to waiting. We covered his Stockholm return earlier this fall if you want the live-show side: [Rocky at Avicii Arena](/the-lane/asap-rocky-stockholm-avicii-arena-return-helicopter-entrance-rihanna-dont-be-dumb-tour-september-21-2026).\n\n## Unverified\n\nOct. 16 date, title and the Metro Boomin tease all come through secondhand posts. No tracklist, no features, no Disc 2 date confirmed.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [Ratings Game Music — Top 5 Stories of the Day (Oct. 14, 2026)](https://ratingsgamemusic.com/2026/10/14/top-5-stories-of-the-day-october-14-2026/)\n- [Ratings Game Music — A$AP Rocky Teases \"DON'T BE DUMB\" Disc 2 With \"2DUMB\" (Aug. 27, 2026)](https://ratingsgamemusic.com/2026/08/27/asap-rocky-dont-be-dumb-disc-2-2dumb/)\n",
