    "body": "The Air Jordan 5 \"Halloween\" is out Saturday, Oct. 17, which makes it the first Jordan retro of the weekend and the last big one before the AJ12 \"Fireside\" lands Oct. 24.\n\n## The shoe\nStyle code HQ7978-001, colorway Black/Picante Red-Green, per [Sole Retriever](https://www.soleretriever.com/news/articles/air-jordan-5-retro-halloween-official-images). The gimmick is the glow: [HotNewHipHop](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1012358-air-jordan-5-halloween-sneaker-news-3) describes green on the tongue Jumpman, the \"23\" near the heel and the Nike Air logo on the back, with a translucent outsole that glows once the lights go out.\n\n![Air Jordan 5 Halloween HQ7978-001 official images](https://images.soleretriever.com/blog/20d79490525299aaac206132c6679ac9e0d80a22-1240x720.png?rect=0,35,1240,651&w=1200&h=630&fit=fill&auto=format \"Sole Retriever|https://www.soleretriever.com/news/articles/air-jordan-5-retro-halloween-official-images\")\n\n## Price and where\nSole Retriever and the [Sneaker News Oct. calendar](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/30/air-jordan-release-dates-october-2026/) list $220. HotNewHipHop says $215. We are going with $220, and the retailer price on release morning wins. Expect Nike and SNKRS plus Jordan retailers (HotNewHipHop names Foot Locker, Finish Line and Hibbett), in family sizing. Neither source gives a drop time.\n\n## Why it is not just a seasonal shoe\nThe 5 is the silhouette with the P-51 Mustang tooth lines and the reflective tongue, and Jordan Brand keeps giving it a second life in the dark. We broke down that design history in [the AJ5 and the Mustang](https://www.sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/air-jordan-5-p51-mustang-tinker-hatfield-reflective-tongue-history). Pair that with a drop three weeks out from the holiday and you get the pattern: the resale conversation is already priced into the shoe before it hits the shelf, which is why a general release this size is the one to run for retail.\n\n## The week\nSat. Oct. 17: AJ5 \"Halloween\" ($220). Sat. Oct. 24: AJ12 \"Fireside\" (CT8013-105, $220). Sat. Oct. 31: AJ14 \"Forest Green\" (487471-300, $215). Dates per Sneaker News; times are not published yet.\n\n## Sources\n- [Sole Retriever - Air Jordan 5 Retro Halloween official images (Oct. 5, 2026)](https://www.soleretriever.com/news/articles/air-jordan-5-retro-halloween-official-images)\n- [HotNewHipHop - The Air Jordan 5 \"Halloween\" Is Dropping Just In Time (Oct. 7, 2026)](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1012358-air-jordan-5-halloween-sneaker-news-3)\n- [Sneaker News - Air Jordan release dates, October 2026 (Sept. 30, 2026)](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/30/air-jordan-release-dates-october-2026/)\n",
