    "body": "We didn't find a new patch or DLC announcement for the game this week. That's fine. The anime is the news.\n\nEdgerunners 2 hits Netflix Oct. 20, per [CD PROJEKT RED's press center](https://press.cdprojektred.com/en/news/1837/cyberpunk-edgerunners-2-premiere-date-announced-alongside-new-trailer). If you're a viewer who never touched the game, Night City is a single-player RPG you can pick up on your own schedule. The Phantom Liberty expansion is part of the Ultimate Edition.\n\nCheck your platform's store for current pricing. We aren't listing sales we haven't verified.\n\n## Sources\n- [CD PROJEKT RED press center - Edgerunners 2 premiere date](https://press.cdprojektred.com/en/news/1837/cyberpunk-edgerunners-2-premiere-date-announced-alongside-new-trailer)\n",
