    "heroCredit": "XXL",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.xxlmag.com/blueface-face-tattoos/",
    "heroFocus": "center top",
    "body": "Blueface proposed to Chrisean Rock early Monday, October 12, at Problem Lounge in Scottsdale, Arizona, and she said yes, per [XXL](https://www.xxlmag.com/blueface-face-tattoos/). Footage shows a sign reading \"Will You Marry Me?\"\n\n## The ink\n\nTwo days later, Wednesday, October 14, Los Angeles tattoo artist Nihat Uzuntepe showed off Blueface's touch-ups. The refresh covered the large Benjamin Franklin portrait on one cheek, the number 100, casino chips, a Maybach emblem on his chin and a Bentley logo on his jaw. The \"B\" in the Bentley logo was changed to a \"C,\" which XXL ties to his Crip affiliation.\n\nChrisean Rock updated her own face tattoo of Blueface in the same session. She got it in 2024, went through two laser sessions to remove it during their 2025 split, and has now reversed course.\n\n## The timeline\n\nFast, even by their standards. Blueface dated Nevaeh Akira, and the two welcomed a child in August. They broke up soon after, and he rekindled things with Rock. We [covered the lawsuit mess around the pair](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/blueface-sued-chrisean-rock-ppv-piracy-skyy-myles-blk-prime-2026) earlier this fall, so none of this is a straight line.\n\n## The take\n\nReal talk — an engagement and a tattoo session in the same week tells you where their heads are, not where the relationship goes. Their history says plan for plot twists. I'm not putting a date on a wedding, and nobody else should either.\n\n## Unconfirmed\n\nNo wedding date or details have been reported.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [XXL — Blueface Shows Off Fresh Touch-Up of His Face Tattoos (Oct. 15, 2026)](https://www.xxlmag.com/blueface-face-tattoos/)",
