    "heroFocus": "center",
    "body": "*Escape Academy 2: Back 2 School* comes to PS5 on November 5, 2026, per a [PlayStation Blog post](https://blog.playstation.com/2026/10/13/escape-academy-2-back-2-school-comes-to-ps5-on-november-5/) dated October 13 and written by Michelle Huttunen, Art Director at Coin Crew Games.\n\n## What changes\n\nThe first game kept you in escape rooms. The sequel breaks out. PlayStation Blog describes a \"fully explorable and puzzling open-world campus,\" with puzzles that run beyond single rooms. Landmarks you can interact with. Side quests. Extra escapes. Hidden keyhole embellishments to hunt around the Academy.\n\n## Co-op\n\nCouch or online co-op from launch, covering the full campus, story and puzzles. That's the right call for this series. Puzzle games live in the argument over who sees the answer first.\n\n## New areas\n\nThe Headmaster's Tower and the Humanities Campus are called out as expanded areas. The post says the game is built for newcomers and players of the first *Escape Academy* alike.\n\n## The take\n\nLook, an open campus is a bigger swing than a re-skinned room pack. It also raises the risk: puzzle design gets harder to pace when players can wander. A couch-co-op puzzle game is a solid fit for the holidays, and November 5 puts it ahead of the busy stretch.\n\n## Unconfirmed\n\nThe PlayStation Blog post doesn't list a price, pre-order bonuses or PlayStation Plus details. It lists PS5 only. Check the PlayStation Store listing for pricing before you buy.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [PlayStation Blog — Escape Academy 2: Back 2 School comes to PS5 on November 5 (Oct. 13, 2026)](https://blog.playstation.com/2026/10/13/escape-academy-2-back-2-school-comes-to-ps5-on-november-5/)",
