    "title": "Nino Paid and Warhol.SS Charged With Felony Murder in Atlanta",
    "headline": "Nino Paid and Warhol.SS\nCharged in Atlanta.",
    "subhead": "Police say a 29-year-old man shot near Old Fourth Ward on April 25 later died. Both rappers face felony murder and armed robbery charges and are being held without bond.",
    "description": "Nino Paid and Warhol.SS face felony murder, armed robbery and aggravated assault charges tied to an April 25 Atlanta shooting, per XXL. Both held without bond.",
