      "body": "The Air Jordan 10 \"Sacramento\" (HJ6779-002) is set for December 5, 2026, per [Sneaker News](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/09/air-jordan-10-sacramento-hj6779-002/), and the price depends on who you ask. Sneaker News' article text says $205 for adults. Its own \"where to buy\" box says $215. [SneakerFiles](https://www.sneakerfiles.com/air-jordan-release-dates/) also lists $215. Plan for $215 and be pleasantly surprised if it's less.\n\n## What it looks like\n\nSimple. Tumbled black leather upper, Dark Concord on the interior and the outsole. Sneaker News says it reads almost identical to the original pair, which is the right call. The 10 doesn't need decoration. The ribbed midsole lines already do the talking.\n\nSneakerFiles describes the palette as black with metallic silver and dark blue, so expect a little shine somewhere. Check the first retail photos before you decide what you're getting.\n\n## Where to buy\n\nRight now Nike SNKRS is the only retailer on the listing, marked \"Coming Soon.\" That can change. Jordan retros usually widen to a few shops closer to the date, but nobody's confirmed it here.\n\n## The take\n\nLook, the 10 never gets the airtime the 3, 4 or 11 get. That's why it's a good pickup. It's the retirement-year shoe, the one built around [the Steel City series](/the-lane/air-jordan-10-steel-city-series-retirement-shoe-history) when Jordan stepped away in 1994. A clean black pair with a little purple inside is easy to wear and probably easier to find than the shoes dropping a week later, like the [Air Jordan 11 Space Jam on December 12](/the-lane/air-jordan-11-space-jam-30th-anniversary-collection-december-12-green-screen-magic-ball-november-2026).\n\nDates move. Confirm with Nike or a retailer before you plan around it.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [Sneaker News — Air Jordan 10 \"Sacramento\" HJ6779-002 (Sept. 9, 2026)](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/09/air-jordan-10-sacramento-hj6779-002/)\n- [SneakerFiles — Air Jordan release dates 2026 + 2027 (accessed Oct. 19, 2026)](https://www.sneakerfiles.com/air-jordan-release-dates/)",
      "goLiveAt": "2026-10-19"
