      "heroCredit": "PlayStation",
      "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.playstation.com/en-us/games/dragon-quest-monsters-the-withered-world/",
      "body": "Dragon Quest Monsters: The Withered World launches December 3, 2026 on PS5, per Sony's [State of Play recap on PlayStation Blog](https://blog.playstation.com/2026/09/03/state-of-play-state-of-play-japan-all-announcements-trailers/). It's also coming to Xbox Series, Switch 2, Switch and PC (Steam and the Microsoft Store), according to [Gematsu](https://www.gematsu.com/2026/06/dragon-quest-monsters-the-withered-world-launches-december-3), which broke the date in June with Square Enix and TOSE named as developers.\n\n## Price and editions\n\nPer Gematsu's June 9 report, the Standard Edition is $59.99 and comes with digital pre-order bonuses, an Adventure Starter Set and a Hearty Meat Set. The Digital Deluxe is $94.99. It adds a four-item DLC set (The Mega Mole Hole, Monster Marathons, Metallic Ring, Scout Run VIP Card), a Necklace of Animation, Beastie Bites, Seeds of Skill, and 48 hours of early access. Prices were stated in June, so check the PlayStation Store before you pre-order.\n\n## What you're doing\n\nYou befriend monsters from across the Dragon Quest series, raise them, and synthesize new ones. Monsters can learn talents to shape your party. It's an open world with its own visual style, monsters follow you as you explore regardless of size, and there are online battles including tournaments and casual matches.\n\n## Demo\n\n[RPG Site's headline](https://www.rpgsite.net/news/21382-dragon-quest-monsters-the-withered-world-demo-is-now-available-on-switch-2-switch-ps5-xbox-and-pc-steam) says a demo is available on Switch 2, Switch, PS5, Xbox and Steam. The page wouldn't load for me, so I can't confirm whether demo progress carries into the full game. Check the in-game notes before you sink hours into it.\n\n## The take\n\nReal talk, monster collecting is a whole childhood for a lot of us. Dragon Quest Monsters has been around for decades, and [Push Square's headline](https://pushsquare.com/news/2026/06/for-the-first-time-in-decades-dragon-quest-monsters-is-coming-to-playstation) frames this as the first time in decades it's come to PlayStation. December already has [Gran Turismo 7's second Spec IV update](/the-lane/gran-turismo-7-spec-iv-sportsland-sugo-october-autumn-ring-december-2026) landing. If you want something slower than a racing game, play the demo and decide.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [PlayStation Blog — State of Play & State of Play Japan: all announcements (Sept. 3, 2026)](https://blog.playstation.com/2026/09/03/state-of-play-state-of-play-japan-all-announcements-trailers/)\n- [Gematsu — Dragon Quest Monsters: The Withered World launches December 3 (June 9, 2026)](https://www.gematsu.com/2026/06/dragon-quest-monsters-the-withered-world-launches-december-3)\n- [RPG Site — Dragon Quest Monsters: The Withered World demo is now available](https://www.rpgsite.net/news/21382-dragon-quest-monsters-the-withered-world-demo-is-now-available-on-switch-2-switch-ps5-xbox-and-pc-steam)\n- [Push Square — For the first time in decades, Dragon Quest Monsters is coming to PlayStation](https://pushsquare.com/news/2026/06/for-the-first-time-in-decades-dragon-quest-monsters-is-coming-to-playstation)",
